claim.claim-text:
a cylindrical member (227) comprising a centerline axis;
a hollow shaft (228) extending from the cylindrical member, the hollow shaft and the cylindrical member in concentric alignment;
a liner (222) disposed on a radially outer surface of the cylindrical member; and
a magnetic member disposed on a radially inward surface of the cylindrical member, wherein the hollow shaft is located externally from and axially adjacent to the cylindrical member.
